    {
      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-2979",
      "display_title": "Issue #2979: Disable Automatic Onboarding Tooltip Timer on Panorama Initialisation",
      "main_description_html": "<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-4acc32a9-f4ea-4474-9eb1-8b0cc06e4e80.png\"><img width=\"175\" height=\"304\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-4acc32a9-f4ea-4474-9eb1-8b0cc06e4e80.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 304px;; aspect-ratio: 175 / 304; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Description:</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The central \"360° Drag to look around\" instruction prompt currently appears for 2–3 seconds every single time a panorama is loaded, cluttering the view. This overlay needs to be removed from standard panorama playback.<br>\nRefactor the viewer component lifecycle to eliminate the automatic timer that triggers the instruction overlay on every panorama navigation event.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance Criteria:</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Remove the automatic render overlay timer for the \"360° Drag to look around\" component when switching or opening panoramas.</li>\n<li>(Optional) If onboarding cues are retained, show them strictly on first-time app launch only using local persistent storage (AsyncStorage / localStorage).</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo by Developer</h2>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">WhatsApp.Video.2026-09-03.at.14.20.37.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"videos/video-852c8010-a3d0-4ae5-bbbc-c2a65aef49d6.mp4\" data-canonical-src=\"videos/video-852c8010-a3d0-4ae5-bbbc-c2a65aef49d6.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n",
