    {
      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-panorra-2981",
      "display_title": "Issue #2981: Refactor Explore 360° Posts List Component and Layout Structure",
      "main_description_html": "<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-8042b797-f301-4ca5-a506-e58a47ac24eb.png\"><img width=\"275\" height=\"229\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-8042b797-f301-4ca5-a506-e58a47ac24eb.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 229px;; aspect-ratio: 275 / 229; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Description:</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update list rendering properties in the Explore screen to switch from a multi-column grid to a single-column list view while stripping unnecessary badge elements.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance Criteria:</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Reconfigure list container props (e.g., numColumns = 1 in FlatList / flex layout) for the 360° Posts tab.</li>\n<li>Remove the 360° badge sub-component from the thumbnail render item.</li>\n<li>Verify image lazy-loading, caching, and scroll performance with full-width preview cards.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo by Developer</h2>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-7039b0fa-7ad0-4994-a4bd-47e022c48049.jpg\"><img width=\"400\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-7039b0fa-7ad0-4994-a4bd-47e022c48049.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>",
